      "raw": "A question about the card mistbound in the Nightmist deck.\r\n\r\nOne of our players just used Mistbound to lock down the villain deck, discarding cards and all so the effect took place. Now she's forced by the environment to play another Mistbound. She still has enough cards in hand to accomodate the discard requirement, but is she forced to do so? Can she opt out and just discard the mistbound without triggering the effect? \r\n\r\nI think she has to discard because the card doesn't say \"may\", but I'm not sure. I think the card requirement is so that you cannot play it as the last cad in your hand, discard nothing and then still get the benefits.\r\n\r\nThanks in advance for any pointers.\r\n\r\nRegards,",
